# Rever from the C menu on a dead member (TechEffect_Rever, ps2.asm:15564).
# Its first step takes the TP and shows $10A ("... comes back to life!");
# its later steps are Res's from the window close on (loc_A6BE), one step
# earlier than Res's own count, since Rever subtracts once before joining
# and Res twice: the close, 30 frames, then 30 HP (the Rever case of
# loc_A6D4) and SXFID_Revived. Up to build 96b the port handed Rever's
# step n to Res as step n, so the step after the message was Res's close
# and the member stayed dead with the TP gone.
#
# The save is story_dark_force.json with Rudo's HP at 0 (Aukba). Rolf
# L41 knows Rever (map list stop 4, 30 TP).

start slot 1 routes/saves/rever_rudo_dead.json
wait idle
press c                      # the save's six lines in the building
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level $0A
expect stat 1 hp 0 0
press c                      # the C menu
wait idle
press down
press down
press c                      # TECH
wait idle
press c                      # Rolf
wait idle
press down
press down
press down
press down
press c                      # Rever
wait idle
press down
press c                      # on Rudo
wait idle
expect script $010A
shot 01_rever
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
expect stat 0 tp 116 116
expect stat 1 hp 30 30
shot 02_rudo_back
